title: GettingStarted

! Offline Mermaid v11+ for TiddlyWiki5

Welcome to the demo wiki for the ''Mermaid for TiddlyWiki5'' plugin (`$:/plugins/mblackman/mermaid`).

This plugin bundles **Mermaid v11+** into a completely offline, zero-network package supporting all modern diagram types in both standard WikiText and Markdown tiddlers.

!! WikiText Fenced Block Example

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([User Request]) --> Review[Review Spec]
    Review --> Plan[/Implementation Plan/]
    Plan --> Approval{Approved?}
    Approval -->|Yes| Build[Bundle Mermaid v11 & Build Plugin]
    Approval -->|No| Revise[Refine Plan]
    Build --> Verify[Automated Tests & Headless Verification]
    Verify --> Done([Production Ready])
```

!! Markdown Integration

Mermaid works seamlessly inside Markdown notes (`text/x-markdown` or `text/markdown`)!
Open [[MarkdownNoteExample]] to see a pure Markdown note with embedded diagrams.

